{"task_id": "HumanEval/17", "solution": "```python\nfrom typing import List\n\n\ndef parse_music(music_string: str) -> List[int]:\n    \"\"\" Input to this function is a string representing musical notes in a special ASCII format.\n    It parses the string and returns a list of integers corresponding to each note's duration in beats.\n    \"\"\"\n    NOTE_MAPPINGS = {\n        'o': 4,   # whole note\n        'o|': 2,  # half note\n        '.|': 1   # quarter note\n    }\n\n    beat_durations = []\n    if music_string: # Only process if the string is not empty\n        note_tokens = music_string.split(' ')\n        for token in note_tokens:\n            if token in NOTE_MAPPINGS:\n                beat_durations.append(NOTE_MAPPINGS[token])\n\n    return beat_durations\n```\n"}
