{"task_id": "HumanEval/31", "solution": "```python\ndef is_prime(n):\n    \"\"\"Return true if a given number is prime, and false otherwise.\n    Handles n=1 as non-prime, adhering to mathematical definition.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 1:\n        return False\n    if n <= 3:\n        return True\n    if n % 2 == 0 or n % 3 == 0:\n        return False\n    i = 5\n    while i * i <= n:\n        if n % i == 0 or n % (i + 2) == 0:\n            return False\n        i += 6\n    return True\n\n```"}
