{"task_id": "HumanEval/91", "solution": "```python\nimport re\n\ndef _split_and_clean_sentences(text: str, delimiters: list) -> list[str]:\n    \"\"\"Splits text into sentences, stripping whitespace and filtering empty strings.\"\"\"\n    # Construct a regex pattern from delimiters, ensuring they are escaped\n    # and handle one or more consecutive delimiters.\n    pattern = r'[' + re.escape(\"\".join(delimiters)) + r']+'\n\n    segments = re.split(pattern, text)\n\n    cleaned_sentences = []\n    for segment in segments:\n        trimmed_segment = segment.strip()\n        if trimmed_segment:\n            cleaned_sentences.append(trimmed_segment)\n\n    return cleaned_sentences\n\ndef _is_bored_sentence(sentence_text: str) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if a sentence starts with the exact word 'I' (case-sensitive).\"\"\"\n    return sentence_text == \"I\" or sentence_text.startswith(\"I \")\n\ndef is_bored(S):\n    \"\"\"Counts sentences starting with \"I\" (case-sensitive) within a given text.\"\"\"\n    boredom_count = 0\n    delimiters = ['.', '?', '!']\n\n    sentences = _split_and_clean_sentences(S, delimiters)\n\n    for sentence in sentences:\n        if _is_bored_sentence(sentence):\n            boredom_count += 1\n\n    return boredom_count\n```"}
{"task_id": "HumanEval/86", "solution": "import re\n\ndef anti_shuffle(s):\n    \"\"\"\n    Sorts characters within each word of the input string in ascending ASCII order,\n    preserving word order and blank spaces. It returns the transformed string.\n    \"\"\"\n    segments = re.findall(r'\\S+|\\s+', s)\n    processed_segments = []\n    for segment in segments:\n        if segment.isspace():\n            processed_segments.append(segment)\n        else:\n            processed_segments.append(\"\".join(sorted(segment)))\n    return \"\".join(processed_segments)"}
